# The sdist carries the documents an agent or a reader may want next to the code.
# NOTE: this is sdist only. A wheel installs the package directory, so llms.txt does
# NOT travel inside a `pip install` from a wheel — unlike sl4n, where it ships inside
# the nupkg. Fixing that would mean a second copy under slpy/, and a duplicated file
# that can drift is worse than the gap. The canonical copy lives at the repo root.
include llms.txt
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include SECURITY.md
include LICENSE
include PARITY-ROADMAP.md
include pytest.ini
recursive-include tests *.py *.json
